  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Quantum Technologies & Advanced Computing Institute: This institute
    is focused on quantum computing and other advanced computing paradigms. Its mission
    includes developing quantum algorithms, exploring quantum communication (quantum
    encryption/QKD), and fostering capability in quantum hardware (like superconducting
    qubits or photonic systems). Additionally, it looks at cutting-edge classical
    computing architectures (high-performance computing, neuromorphic computing)
    and cloud computing platforms for scientific research. The institute\u2019s aim
    is to prepare Saudi Arabia for the quantum revolution by building expertise,
    contributing to global research (quantum simulation, etc.), and identifying early
    use-cases of quantum computing in areas like optimization, cryptography, and
    material science. It also engages in training the next generation of quantum
    scientists through programs and partnerships"
  description: 
